    "description": "Developed a set of shell scripts used to monitor the performance of the physical and the\nvirtual servers which conform the infrastructure of the MVNO network, this set of shell scripts are\nused also to fetch, stored and deploy information related to the business operations, such as: the\nclients billing processes and the Customer relationship management processes, for which all the\noperations logs are monitored such that all the errors and exceptions are detected and reported.\nIn order to be able to visualize the outcome of the business operations along with the system\nperformance, I was also in charge of the development of web applications that fetch,\nprocess, organize and display the must pertinent information stored among the databases of\nthe infrastructure without interfering with the main operations of the business, such that the\nwhole team would have a complete understanding of the current status of the system and the\noccurrence of any critical error is guaranteed to be detected and reported to the corresponding\narea. These web applications were built using HML5,JAVA, C# and JavaScript.",
